arduino~ish usb-serial lib for the ch32x03x (only tested on 033f8p6, wit pio board genericCH32X035F8U6)
modified the files from WCH found here: https://github.com/openwch/ch32x035/tree/main/EVT/EXAM/USB/USBFS/DEVICE/SimulateCDC
removed the UART references, addes some read/write functions.
Not tested on mounriver, but might work if the files are placed in the right folders.
